{"page":541,"verses":[{"verse_key":"57:25","surah":57,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"لَقَدْ أَرْسَلْنَا رُسُلَنَا بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ وَأَنزَلْنَا مَعَهُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ وَٱلْمِيزَانَ لِيَقُومَ ٱلنَّاسُ بِٱلْقِسْطِ ۖ وَأَنزَلْنَا ٱلْحَدِيدَ فِيهِ بَأْسٌ شَدِيدٌ وَمَنَـٰفِعُ لِلنَّاسِ وَلِيَعْلَمَ ٱللَّهُ مَن يَنصُرُهُۥ وَرُسُلَهُۥ بِٱلْغَيْبِ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ قَوِىٌّ عَزِيزٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We sent Our messengers with clear signs, the Scripture and the Balance, so that people could uphold justice: We also sent iron, with its mighty strength and many uses for mankind, so that God could mark out those who would help Him and His messengers though they cannot see Him. Truly God is powerful, almighty.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَقَدْ","en_gloss":"Certainly","transliteration":"laqad","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رُسُلَنَا","en_gloss":"Our Messengers","transliteration":"rusulanā","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"with clear proofs","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَنزَلْنَا","en_gloss":"and We sent down","transliteration":"wa-anzalnā","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَعَهُمُ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"maʿahumu","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Scripture","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلْمِيزَانَ","en_gloss":"and the Balance","transliteration":"wal-mīzāna","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِيَقُومَ","en_gloss":"that may establish","transliteration":"liyaqūma","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsu","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِٱلْقِسْطِ ۖ","en_gloss":"justice","transliteration":"bil-qis'ṭi","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأَنزَلْنَا","en_gloss":"And We sent down","transliteration":"wa-anzalnā","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْحَدِيدَ","en_gloss":"[the] iron","transliteration":"l-ḥadīda","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"wherein","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بَأْسٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) power","transliteration":"basun","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":16,"ar":"شَدِيدٌۭ","en_gloss":"mighty","transliteration":"shadīdun","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَمَنَـٰفِعُ","en_gloss":"and benefits","transliteration":"wamanāfiʿu","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لِلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"for the people","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَلِيَعْلَمَ","en_gloss":"and so that Allah may make evident","transliteration":"waliyaʿlama","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"and so that Allah may make evident","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":21,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(he) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":22,"ar":"يَنصُرُهُۥ","en_gloss":"helps Him","transliteration":"yanṣuruhu","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":23,"ar":"وَرُسُلَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and His Messengers","transliteration":"warusulahu","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":24,"ar":"بِٱلْغَيْبِ ۚ","en_gloss":"unseen","transliteration":"bil-ghaybi","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":25,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":26,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":27,"ar":"قَوِىٌّ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Strong","transliteration":"qawiyyun","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":28,"ar":"عَزِيزٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Mighty","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","verse_key":"57:25"},{"pos":29,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"57:25"}]},{"verse_key":"57:26","surah":57,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ أَرْسَلْنَا نُوحًا وَإِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَجَعَلْنَا فِى ذُرِّيَّتِهِمَا ٱلنُّبُوَّةَ وَٱلْكِتَـٰبَ ۖ فَمِنْهُم مُّهْتَدٍ ۖ وَكَثِيرٌ مِّنْهُمْ فَـٰسِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We sent Noah and Abraham, and gave prophethood and scripture to their offspring: among them there were some who were rightly guided, but many were lawbreakers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نُوحًۭا","en_gloss":"Nuh","transliteration":"nūḥan","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَإِبْرَٰهِيمَ","en_gloss":"and Ibrahim","transliteration":"wa-ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"and We placed","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ذُرِّيَّتِهِمَا","en_gloss":"their offspring","transliteration":"dhurriyyatihimā","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلنُّبُوَّةَ","en_gloss":"Prophethood","transliteration":"l-nubuwata","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلْكِتَـٰبَ ۖ","en_gloss":"and the Scripture","transliteration":"wal-kitāba","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَمِنْهُم","en_gloss":"and among them","transliteration":"famin'hum","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُّهْتَدٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) a guided one","transliteration":"muh'tadin","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَكَثِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"but most","transliteration":"wakathīrun","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فَـٰسِقُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) defiantly disobediently","transliteration":"fāsiqūna","verse_key":"57:26"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٢٦","en_gloss":"(26)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"57:26"}]},{"verse_key":"57:27","surah":57,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ قَفَّيْنَا عَلَىٰٓ ءَاثَـٰرِهِم بِرُسُلِنَا وَقَفَّيْنَا بِعِيسَى ٱبْنِ مَرْيَمَ وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ ٱلْإِنجِيلَ وَجَعَلْنَا فِى قُلُوبِ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱتَّبَعُوهُ رَأْفَةً وَرَحْمَةً وَرَهْبَانِيَّةً ٱبْتَدَعُوهَا مَا كَتَبْنَـٰهَا عَلَيْهِمْ إِلَّا ٱبْتِغَآءَ رِضْوَٰنِ ٱللَّهِ فَمَا رَعَوْهَا حَقَّ رِعَايَتِهَا ۖ فَـَٔاتَيْنَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ مِنْهُمْ أَجْرَهُمْ ۖ وَكَثِيرٌ مِّنْهُمْ فَـٰسِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We sent other messengers to follow in their footsteps. After those We sent Jesus, son of Mary: We gave him the Gospel and put compassion and mercy into the hearts of his followers. But monasticism was something they invented- We did not ordain it for them- only to seek God’s pleasure, and even so, they did not observe it properly. So We gave a reward to those of them who believed, but many of them were lawbreakers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَفَّيْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"qaffaynā","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَاثَـٰرِهِم","en_gloss":"their footsteps","transliteration":"āthārihim","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِرُسُلِنَا","en_gloss":"Our Messengers","transliteration":"birusulinā","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَقَفَّيْنَا","en_gloss":"and We followed","transliteration":"waqaffaynā","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِعِيسَى","en_gloss":"with Isa","transliteration":"biʿīsā","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱبْنِ","en_gloss":"son","transliteration":"ib'ni","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَرْيَمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Maryam","transliteration":"maryama","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"and We gave him","transliteration":"waātaynāhu","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْإِنجِيلَ","en_gloss":"the Injeel","transliteration":"l-injīla","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"And We placed","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قُلُوبِ","en_gloss":"(the) hearts","transliteration":"qulūbi","verse_key":"57:27"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of)